{"4448970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Worlds of Narayana VR", "steam_appid": 4448970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Transcendent Cosmic Journey</strong> <i>Narayana VR</i> is an awe-inspiring virtual reality experience that invites you to step into the different worlds of Narayana where he resides. Leave the physical world behind and immerse yourself in an interactive spiritual journey where you will witness the scale of the universe compared to Lord Narayana, the cycle of creation, and the ultimate dissolution of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/d7773a8cd83f7df69e8db0651a4671e3.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/d7773a8cd83f7df69e8db0651a4671e3.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=795 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your journey begins in the absolute tranquility of the cosmic eggs. As you transition into the <strong>Ksheerasagaram</strong> (The Milky Ocean), you are greeted by the magnificent sight of Lord Srimannarayana resting upon the divine serpent, Adishesha. All around you float countless shimmering spheres. These are  <i>Andas</i> (Cosmic Eggs)—each containing a universe. You can physically navigate through this space, choose a cosmic egg, and step inside to witness the world inside within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/c963bebcf9d8eac7bdb01cfc471af7df.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/c963bebcf9d8eac7bdb01cfc471af7df.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the Cycle of Creation and Dissolution</strong> Beyond the cosmic eggs lies the very source of existence. Travel closer to witness the divine mechanics of the universe:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dawn of Creation:</strong> Gaze upon the Navel Lotus (Nabhi Kamalam) of Lord Narayana. From this origin, Lord Brahma emerges, bringing forth a magnificent stream of stars, worlds, and life into the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Return:</strong> Experience the profound concept of <i>Laya</i> (Dissolution). Stand amidst the cosmos as all elements, creatures, and lifeforms from every corner of the universe flow back in a mesmerizing cosmic river, merging once again into the supreme source to attain eternal peace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/0ad9cd91b66d9554565c027b64501a68.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/0ad9cd91b66d9554565c027b64501a68.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Scale:</strong> Experience the mind-bending scale of Hindu cosmology, built specifically for the depth of Virtual Reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environments:</strong> Don't just watch—explore. Navigate through the Milky Ocean and physically enter cosmic eggs to discover the celestial bodies inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Guided Spiritual Path:</strong> Beautifully crafted narration guides you through the philosophical concepts of creation, preservation, and dissolution, providing deep context to the visuals around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative Atmosphere:</strong> Designed to be a serene, awe-inspiring experience rather than a traditional high-stress game. Perfect for relaxation, spiritual reflection, and experiencing absolute tranquility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/70edc5a2fe823f1bdee96f42f133ea42.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/70edc5a2fe823f1bdee96f42f133ea42.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=755 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Transcendent Cosmic Journey</strong> <i>Narayana VR</i> is an awe-inspiring virtual reality experience that invites you to step into the different worlds of Narayana where he resides. Leave the physical world behind and immerse yourself in an interactive spiritual journey where you will witness the scale of the universe compared to Lord Narayana, the cycle of creation, and the ultimate dissolution of all life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/d7773a8cd83f7df69e8db0651a4671e3.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/d7773a8cd83f7df69e8db0651a4671e3.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=795 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your journey begins in the absolute tranquility of the cosmic eggs. As you transition into the <strong>Ksheerasagaram</strong> (The Milky Ocean), you are greeted by the magnificent sight of Lord Srimannarayana resting upon the divine serpent, Adishesha. All around you float countless shimmering spheres. These are  <i>Andas</i> (Cosmic Eggs)—each containing a universe. You can physically navigate through this space, choose a cosmic egg, and step inside to witness the world inside within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/c963bebcf9d8eac7bdb01cfc471af7df.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/c963bebcf9d8eac7bdb01cfc471af7df.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witness the Cycle of Creation and Dissolution</strong> Beyond the cosmic eggs lies the very source of existence. Travel closer to witness the divine mechanics of the universe:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dawn of Creation:</strong> Gaze upon the Navel Lotus (Nabhi Kamalam) of Lord Narayana. From this origin, Lord Brahma emerges, bringing forth a magnificent stream of stars, worlds, and life into the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Return:</strong> Experience the profound concept of <i>Laya</i> (Dissolution). Stand amidst the cosmos as all elements, creatures, and lifeforms from every corner of the universe flow back in a mesmerizing cosmic river, merging once again into the supreme source to attain eternal peace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras/0ad9cd91b66d9554565c027b64501a68.avif?t=1785034404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448970/extras_big/0ad9cd91b66d9554565c027b64501a68.webp?t=1785034404 width=1560 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul clas